- [ ] 2.2 Verify existing hybrid retrieval behavior still retrieves the original query first, merges a state-alternate result by LD id without duplicate modality credit, and keeps original candidates when alternate retrieval fails; add focused mocked retriever regressions only where current coverage does not exercise the new canonical representation.

